## III. Critical Boundaries

### The Chancellor's Gatekeeping
The **Chancellor is the only entity that writes to the TUI Main Window when no Audience is active**. When an LLM Session (Audience) is active, the window is "possessed" by that minister—the Chancellor cannot interject except through:
1. **Zhengming interrupts** (pausing the stream to ask for clarification)
2. **Flatline** (force-canceling the context)

### LLM Session ≠ Edict
**One Edict, Many Audiences**: A single Edict may require sequential audiences:
